{
  "title": "iLipidome: lipidomics data analysis in the context of the lipid biosynthetic network",
  "description": "<p>iLipidome is an R package for analyzing lipidomics data in the context of the lipid biosynthetic network. It decomposes measured lipids into fatty-acyl and backbone substructures and propagates abundance changes over the network to score pathways and reactions and to attribute them to enzymes, at the fatty-acid, lipid-class and lipid-species levels.</p><p>Install with <code>devtools::install_github(\"AustinChiangLab/iLipidome-package\")</code>. Source and issue tracker: https://github.com/AustinChiangLab/iLipidome-package</p>",
